author=Cristimato
description=Vulkan 1.3 (blob r49p1) + vkshim v5.0: robustness2 (nullDescriptor), push descriptors, descriptor indexing completo (waterfall), draw_indirect_count, depthClamp exato, depth_clip_enable/control, multi draw, memory budget, clip/wireframe/gl_DrawID emulados, erratas Mali, BC1-BC7 (PixelBC), cache de pipelines, HUD e config por jogo (vkshim-conf/vkshim-hud). GLES continua r32p1.
